    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53329" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰρηβᾰρ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
